--- stdout
Write this project's process into agent instructions

Usage:
  gh dojo agent [flags]
  gh dojo agent [command]

Available Commands:
  install     Write a skill or AGENTS.md section for agents from the config

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for agent

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)

Use "gh dojo agent [command] --help" for more information about a command.
